# Cloud Sync (Firebase) — add your OWN real google-services.json
# locally after running `flutterfire configure` (see SYNC_SETUP.md).
# Never commit a placeholder/fake one — the Gradle plugin that reads
# this file crashes on invalid data with confusing, unrelated-looking
# errors. (lib/firebase_options.dart is NOT ignored — Dart needs that
# file to exist to compile at all, even as a placeholder.)
android/app/google-services.json

